---
description: Select the current acceptance criteria and exact evidence scope for both demos.
args:
  goal: string
  opening: PortfolioFrame
  current: PortfolioFrame
returns: PortfolioPlan
---
1. Choose each requested garden and realm criterion in its stated order. When the goal relies on the current acceptance card, read its text, use its exact digest as criteriaBasis and follow the latest wording. An earlier card may be relevant to explain a change in the handoff but does not replace its current instructions.
2. Match named habitats, residents, routes and regions exactly. Keep an exact missing id if that is the claim to test. For chronological Grimoire transitions always compare opening and current. For Regency distinguish currently saved state, saved change since opening and a forecast change. Record assertCommitted when the claim calls forecast evidence already recorded.
3. Choose only a supported one-to-three-month forecast if asked for. Otherwise keep months null. Set note to none for read-only goals, decision for an explicit private note regardless of result, or ready-only when the user asks to write only if the portfolio is ready.
